{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04993","headline":"辛丑岁十月上幸长安时扈从出西岳作 · 沈佺期","name":"辛丑岁十月上幸长安时扈从出西岳作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西镇何穹崇，壮哉信灵造。\n诸岭皆峻秀，中峯特美好。\n傍见巨掌存，势如石东倒。\n颇闻首阳去，开坼此河道。\n磅礴压洪源，巍峨壮清昊。\n云泉纷乱瀑，天磴屹横抱。\n子先呼其巅，宫女世不老。\n下有府君庙，历载传洒扫。\n皇明应天游，十月戒丰镐。\n微未忝闲从，兼得事苹藻。\n宿心爱兹山，意欲拾灵草。\n阴壑已永閟，云窦绝探讨。\n芳月期来过，回策思方浩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}